# Build context for BOTH images built from services/vision:
#   - vision-inference (object_detection/Dockerfile.server) — YOLO server
#   - face-inference   (Dockerfile.server)                  — insightface pipeline
# Keep the context small; never exclude models/ (the insightface pack) or
# object_detection/models/production/*.pt, which are baked into their images.

# Virtualenvs
.venv
.venv-test
.venv.old
**/.venv

# Python cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache

# Local runtime state / secrets
.env
**/.env
data
*.log

# Training-only artifacts — never needed by either runtime image
object_detection/datasets
object_detection/runs
object_detection/predictions
object_detection/models/candidates
object_detection/models/**/*.onnx
object_detection/models/yolov8n.pt
object_detection/scripts
object_detection/training
object_detection/tests

# Docs / dev-only files
README.md
**/README.md
**/.env.example
run.bat
pyrightconfig.json
**/pyrightconfig.json
